        <mxCell id="hsZLfapZjs0gfuHIcwkx-59" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Backend-后端进程&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
